  "evidences": [
    {
      "id": "ev_1",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ZoxPNG_Full_Analysis-Final",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s1"
      },
      "text": "Overview ZoxPNG is a very simple RAT that uses the PNG image file format as the carrier for data going to and from the C2 server.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_4",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ZoxPNG_Full_Analysis-Final",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s4"
      },
      "text": "If an attacker required such functionality, the attacker would construct a simple shell-code binary which the ZoxPNG binary could execute thereby expanding the feature set of the Trojan.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_7",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ZoxPNG_Full_Analysis-Final",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s7"
      },
      "text": "With the handlers registered, ZoxPNG slips into an infinite loop that calls the main communication and command dispatch routine; if that routine returns (or exits), the Trojan sleeps 20 seconds before again calling the main communication and command dispatch routine.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_12",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ZoxPNG_Full_Analysis-Final",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s12"
      },
      "text": "For each request to the C2 server that the ZoxPNG binary generates, the C2 server will respond with a valid HTTP response that includes a PNG file containing the next instruction for the binary to execute.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_41",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ZoxPNG_Full_Analysis-Final",
      "locator": {
        "page": 7,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p7_s3"
      },
      "text": "cmd.exe) to use for the remote shell.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_45",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ZoxPNG_Full_Analysis-Final",
      "locator": {
        "page": 7,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p7_s7"
      },
      "text": "Typically this initial response will be the banner and command prompt from a newly executed cmd.exe.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
