        "sentence_id": "p7_r3"
      },
      "text": "If CreateProcess is successful, the command handler calls the command handler for Remote Shell Interaction ( 0x80061002 ) and pass the original CommandData to the command handler with the dwCommandID field changed to 0x80061002 and the dwPayloadSize set to 0 in order to get the initial response from the remote shell to the C2 server. Typically this initial response will be the banner and command prompt from a newly executed cmd.exe. The command handler will return the response from the Remote Shell Interaction handler as its own.",
